  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 30 - 2 ÷ 4 + 12 × 6 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **Signs**\n **Interchanging Signs**\n \n \n\n +\n -\n \n \n\n -\n ×\n \n \n\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n ÷\n +\n \n \n\n \n\n⇒ 30 × 2 + 4 - __**12 ÷ 6**__ = ?\n\n⇒ ? = __**30 ×**____** 2**__ + 4 - 2\n\n⇒ ? =** __60 + 4__** - 2\n\n⇒ ? = __**64 - 2 **__**= 62**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"6****2**\".",
